}}# Third-party notices

mindfork-rs is distributed under the MIT licence (see `LICENSE`). It links
third-party Rust packages whose own licences are reproduced below, one section
per licence, listing the packages it covers.

This file is generated from the exact `Cargo.lock` of this release
(`cargo about`); the application's About dialog (`F1` → Components) lists the
direct dependencies and the vendored syntax grammars, whose licence texts are in
`licenses/syntaxes/`. Spellcheck dictionaries carry theirs in
`data/dictionaries/licenses/`.

